			<div class="comment_postinfo">
					<span class="fn">Anti-Evil_88</span>				<span class="comment_date">
					on April 15, 2021 at 2:26 pm				</span>
												</div>

			<div class="comment_area">
				
				<div class="comment-content clearfix">
				<p>Wow! That was a spectacular story so far!!!  It had lots of details, smashing sentence structure, and much descriptive conduct!  Can&#8217;t wait to see more!</p>
<span class="reply-container"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-4972" data-commentid="4972" data-postid="14232" data-belowelement="comment-4972" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Anti-Evil_88" aria-label="Reply to Anti-Evil_88">Reply</a></span>				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
		<ul class="children">
	<li class="comment odd alt depth-2 et-pb-non-builder-comment" id="li-comment-4991">
		<article id="comment-4991" class="comment-body clearfix">
			<div class="comment_avatar">
					<img alt='Liam G' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/46932fb9f4448b6e1d8863b6c69e98535b4bb0f3de1c0a61ca5cb8e856132596?s=80&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/46932fb9f4448b6e1d8863b6c69e98535b4bb0f3de1c0a61ca5cb8e856132596?s=160&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-80 photo' height='80' width='80' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>			</div>

			<div class="comment_postinfo">
					<span class="fn">Liam G</span>				<span class="comment_date">
					on April 19, 2021 at 4:59 pm				</span>
												</div>

			<div class="comment_area">
				
				<div class="comment-content clearfix">
				<p>Thanks for the feedback! I&#8217;m glad to be receiving some thoughts from people outside my friends and family. Until now, I thought I&#8217;d never get around to writing Part 2; I&#8217;ll have to make it happen for sure. Keep an eye out, it&#8217;ll show up eventually!</p>
<span class="reply-container"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-4991" data-commentid="4991" data-postid="14232" data-belowelement="comment-4991" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Liam G" aria-label="Reply to Liam G">Reply</a></span>				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
